```
```css
.s1-row {
  position: absolute; left: 6px; right: 6px; height: 70px;
  transition: transform 500ms cubic-bezier(0.22,1,0.36,1), background 200ms;
}
```
Set `dataset.slot`, call `slotRows()`, CSS transitions do the rest. Same pattern duplicated for `.s2-row` (480ms) and `.gh-row` (520ms).

