## 6. THE RECREATION TECHNIQUE — how the fake UI is built

Fidelity is achieved by **copying design tokens verbatim from the real app's CSS**, then rebuilding the markup by hand. The file says so explicitly at `:11-14` and `:216-218`:
```css
/* ============================================================
   TOKENS — verbatim from src/index.css / tailwind.config.ts /
   src/whatsapp/routes/admin/conversations/conversations.css
   ============================================================ */
:root {
  --ink: #141413; --paper: #ffffff; --light: #faf9f5; --line: #e8e6dc; --line-soft: #f1efe8;
  --mid: #b0aea5; --muted: #6b6a63;
  --orange: #d97757; --green: #788c5d; --rose: #c96356; --blue: #6a9bcc;
  /* WhatsApp inbox chrome (.wac) */
  --wa-bg: #0A0A0A; --wa-input: #1F1F1F; --wa-hover: #161616; --wa-active: #262626;
  --wa-t1: #E9EDEF; --wa-t2: #8696A0; --wa-t3: #6B7C85;
  --wa-green: #00A884; --wa-green-bright: #25d366; --wa-tick: #53BDEB;
  --wa-border: #262626; --wa-out: #264C39; --wa-system: #161616;
  --whatsapp: #25D366;
